        },
        {
          "text": "Mbona igisa n’ikiyaga c’ibirahuri kivanze n’umuriro; mbona abatabarutse banesheje ca gikōko n’igishushanyo caco n’igitigiri c’izina ryaco, bahagaze kur’ ico kiyaga c’ibirahuri, bafise inanga z’Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
