            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni nde atazogutinya ga Mwami, cank’ atazohimbaza izina ryawe? Kukw ari wewe wenyene wera, amahanga yose azoza akwikubite imbere, agusenge, kukw amateka yawe agororotse aseruwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.4"
            ]
