            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hasohoka ba bamarayika ndwi bava mur’ urwo rusengero bafise vya vyago ndwi, bambaye impuzu zera zitanduye, zikayangana, kandi bambaye imikanda y’izahabu mu gikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
